Step 3 – Observe Tool Execution

The expected sequence is:

LLM
↓
compute_sla_compliance()
↓
Read vendor_jobs_input
↓
Calculate compliance
↓
Read vendors + vendor_master_input
↓
UPSERT sla_tracker_output
↓
Return response

(Notice that after your latest implementation, the compliance calculation is done within compute_sla_compliance(). The separate get_vendor_jobs_sla() tool may no longer be needed for this workflow if the LLM chooses not to call it.)

